            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick either this unit or a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If you picked this unit, allocate 1 damage point to this unit and add 1 to casting rolls for this unit for the rest of the turn (ward rolls cannot be made for that damage point). 
If you picked an enemy unit, roll a dice. On a 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on that enemy unit and for the rest of the turn:
• Add 1 to casting rolls for this unit.
• Add 1 to this unit&apos;s power level.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
