            <characteristic name="Timing" id="2bcc-9ce7-63d8-a92b" hidden="false" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn, Reaction: Opponent declared a command for a unit within 12&quot; of this unit</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" id="f139-5560-683d-59a7" hidden="false" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" id="bda1-63f8-ee44-8e7d" hidden="false" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, unless your opponent spends 1 additional command point to use that command, the command has no effect, it still counts as having been used and the command points spent to use the command are still lost.</characteristic>
