            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following to apply for the rest of the turn:
**Noble Blade:** This unit&apos;s melee weapons, including **Companion** weapons, have **Crit (Mortal)** instead of **Crit (Auto-wound)**.
