            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an objective you do not control to be the target.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, while enemy units are contesting the target objective, attacks made by those units cannot score critical hits while this unit is also contesting it (treat them as regular hits instead).</characteristic>
