            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Nexus of Grief**, then pick up to 3 friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of it to be the targets. You cannot pick the same unit to be a target of this ability more than once per phase.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For each target:
• If the target is damaged, **Heal (D3)** the target.
• If the target is not damaged, return a number of slain models to it with a combined Health characteristic of up to D3.</characteristic>
