            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this terrain feature from the battlefield and set it up again on the battlefield within 3&quot; of a friendly **^^Nighthaunt^^** unit, more than 3&quot; from all objectives and enemy units, more than 1&quot; from all terrain features and more than 12&quot; from all other friendly **Nexuses of Grief**.</characteristic>
