                        <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, each time the target is picked to use a **^^Core^^** ability, roll a dice as a reaction. On a 4+, inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic>
